 "description": "Frontier (running best by model release date) on competition-math benchmarks. Draw one line per \"benchmark\" field; do not join different benchmarks into one line. 2021 and 2022 points are the paper-reported best on the full MATH test set; from 2023 the MATH line is Epoch AI's own runs on MATH Level 5 (the 1,324 hardest test problems, so scores run lower than full-MATH numbers for the same model). After MATH Level 5 saturated (o1, Dec 2024, 94.7%), the OTIS Mock AIME 2024-2025 line (45 harder, newer competition problems, Epoch AI runs) carries the series to 2026. Held-out research-level math (FrontierMath, private) and open problems (FrontierMath-Erdos) are in other_series. Each point keeps Epoch's model id, Epoch's eval date (evaluated_at), and stderr in percentage points.",
